From f93d869ad14263caad6f13b20acef7d34f424aee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ajensenwaud <ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:58:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 57/60] Muse Spark memory: TF_MUSE_MEMLOG (a rank's memory per
 load stage and graph capture), TF_MUSE_GRAPH_BUCKET (decode graphs keyed at
 one bucket: one a width, same bits), TF_MUSE_GRAPHS (LRU cap on decode
 graphs), TF_MUSE_DROP_CACHE (the pack's pages out of the process and the page
 cache after each layer), TF_MUSE_TRIM (malloc_trim after load and captures);
 all off by default

